msgstr "您正在重命名颜色 {color}"

#: src/strings.ts:2649
msgid "You can adjust how long items live in your trash from Settings -> Trash settings."
msgstr "您可以在 设置 -> 回收站设置 中调整项目在回收站中的保留时长。"

#: src/strings.ts:416
msgid "You can also link a note to multiple Notebooks. Tap and hold any notebook to enable multi-select."
msgstr "您还可以将一篇笔记关联到多个笔记本。长按任意笔记本即可启用多选。"

#: src/strings.ts:2937
msgid "You can also select .zip files containing {extensions} files."
msgstr "您也可以选择 .zip 文件，其中包含 {extensions} 文件。"

#: src/strings.ts:2374
msgid "You can change your subscription plan from the web app"
msgstr "您可以从网页应用更改订阅套餐"

#: src/strings.ts:1328
msgid "You can multi-select notes and move them to a notebook at once"
msgstr "您可以多选笔记并一次性移动到某个笔记本"

#: src/strings.ts:2625
msgid "You can multi-select notes and move them to a notebook or a sub-notebook at once."
msgstr "您可以多选笔记并一次性移动到笔记本或子笔记本。"

#: src/strings.ts:2872
msgid "You can only change your plan from the platform you originally bought the subscription from."
msgstr "您只能在最初购买订阅的平台更改套餐。"

#: src/strings.ts:1319
msgid "You can pin frequently used Notebooks to the Side Menu to quickly access them."
msgstr "您可以将常用的笔记本置顶到侧边菜单，以便快速访问。"

#: src/strings.ts:1071
msgid "You can set a custom proxy URL to increase your privacy."
msgstr "您可以设置自定义代理 URL 以提升隐私性。"

#: src/strings.ts:1300
msgid "You can swipe left anywhere in the app to start a new note."
msgstr "您可以在应用内任意位置向左滑动以新建笔记。"

#: src/strings.ts:1872
msgid "You can track your bug report at [{url}]({url}).\n\nPlease note that we will respond to your bug report on the link above. **We recommend that you save the above link for later reference.**\n\nIf your issue is critical (e.g. notes not syncing, crashes etc.), please [join our Discord community](https://go.notesnook.com/discord) for one-to-one support."
msgstr "您可以在以下位置跟踪您的错误报告：[{url}]({url})。\\n\\n请注意，我们将通过上方链接回复你的错误报告。**建议你保存上方链接以备日后查阅。**\\n\\n如果你的问题很严重（例如笔记无法同步、崩溃等），请[加入我们的 Discord 社区](https://go.notesnook.com/discord)获取一对一支持。"

#: src/strings.ts:1881
msgid "You can track your feature request at [{url}]({url}).\n\nPlease note that we will respond to your feature request on the link above. **We recommend that you save the above link for later reference.**"
msgstr "您可以在以下位置跟踪您的功能请求：[{url}]({url})。\\n\\n请注意，我们将通过上方链接回复你的功能建议。**建议你保存上方链接以备日后查阅。**"

#: src/strings.ts:962
msgid "You can use fallback 2FA method incase you are unable to login via primary method"
msgstr "如果无法通过主要方式登录，您可以使用备用 2FA 方式"

#: src/strings.ts:1342
msgid "You can view & restore older versions of any note by going to its properties -> History."
msgstr "您可以进入任意笔记的 属性 -> 历史版本 查看并还原旧版本。"

#: src/strings.ts:3198
msgid "You cannot move the selected notebook(s) here"
msgstr "无法将所选笔记本移动到此处"

#: src/strings.ts:3023
msgid "You cannot set a default notebook or tag on this plan."
msgstr "此套餐下无法设置默认笔记本或标签。"

#: src/strings.ts:3021
msgid "You cannot upload files larger than {limit} on this plan."
msgstr "此套餐下无法上传大于 {limit} 的文件。"

