msgid "You have unsynced notes. Take a backup or sync your notes to avoid losing your critical data."
msgstr "您有未同步的笔记。请备份或同步笔记，以免丢失重要数据。"

#: src/strings.ts:1515
msgid "You must log out in order to change/reset server URLs."
msgstr "您必须退出登录才能更改/重置服务器 URL。"

#: src/strings.ts:2506
msgid "You need to login to restore attachments from a backup file. [Read more](https://notesnook.com/help/faqs/login-to-restore-attachments-in-backup).\n  \nContinue without attachments?"
msgstr "您需要登录才能从备份文件还原附件。[了解更多](https://notesnook.com/help/faqs/login-to-restore-attachments-in-backup)。\\n  \\n是否继续但不还原附件？"

#: src/strings.ts:3110
msgid "You own your notes, not us. No proprietary formats. No vendor lock in. No waiting for hours to download your notes."
msgstr "您的笔记归您所有，而非我们。没有专有格式，没有供应商锁定，也不用花数小时等待下载笔记。"

#: src/strings.ts:761
msgid "You simply cannot get any better of a note taking app than @notesnook. The UI is clean and slick, it is feature rich, encrypted, reasonably priced (esp. for students & educators) & open source"
msgstr "没有比 @notesnook 更好的笔记应用了。界面简洁精致，功能丰富、加密、价格合理（尤其对学生和教师而言），而且开源"

#: src/strings.ts:972
msgid "You subscribed to Notesnook Pro on {date}. Verify this subscription?"
msgstr "您于 {date}。要验证此订阅吗？"

