msgid "You will only be issued a refund if you are eligible as per our refund policy. Your account will immediately be downgraded to Basic and your funds will be transferred to your account within 24 hours."
msgstr "只有符合我们的退款政策，您才会获得退款。您的账户将立即降级为 Basic，款项将在 24 小时内转回您的账户。"

